---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
Standard: c++20
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 100
AccessModifierOffset: -4
PointerAlignment: Left
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
NamespaceIndentation: None
FixNamespaceComments: true
IncludeBlocks: Regroup
SortIncludes: CaseSensitive
...
---
# Objective-C++ (.mm) -- the macOS platform/UI shims. Same C++ rules; a Language: ObjC
# section must exist or clang-format refuses the file outright ("does not support Objective-C").
Language: ObjC
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
Standard: c++20
IndentWidth: 4
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 100
AccessModifierOffset: -4
PointerAlignment: Left
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
NamespaceIndentation: None
FixNamespaceComments: true
IncludeBlocks: Regroup
SortIncludes: CaseSensitive
ObjCSpaceAfterProperty: false
ObjCSpaceBeforeProtocolList: true
...
